				<wikidot:authorName>AgentWilson</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>802114</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It took me a minute to realize how important the middle reel only having X on it is.</p> <p>One thing of note: three-reel slots aren't that uncommon, and 5 isn't actually based on any kind of standard. The three-reel versions tend to be the tabletop variety, rather than the larger stand-alone machines, though that isn't a hard rule either.</p> <p>Anyway, +1 for getting a simultaneous cringe and laugh out of me.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
